<title>JAPAN: Mishima Paper -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mishima Paper -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.99		vs	    7.68</p>
<p> Operating    loss 44    million    vs	 prft 15 million</p>
<p> Current	     51    million    vs	   45    million</p>
<p> Net		   10    million    vs	   35    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.36 yen	  vs	    1.24 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mishima Paper Co Ltd specialises in production of tissue paper.</p>
</text>
